<#ff82b4>TELEPORT</>
Teleport Forward / Back		_F^X / _B^X
Teleport Up		_U^X
Teleport Down (air)		_D^X
  Works in the air too, and cancels her attacks.
  2 charges from a full gauge (the bar under her life).
  It refills slower while she is comboing, and fast again
  once the combo drops.
Air Heavy ender (3rd in a combo)		^C
  The 3rd Air Heavy in a combo spikes them down with no
  tech and ends the combo. A teleport in between resets it.
TP Frenzy (5 bars)		_D_DB_B^X
  Heat mode: unlimited meter and teleports while it lasts.

<#ff82b4>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Power Charge (hold)		^B_+^C
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B

<#ff82b4>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Lunge Punch		_B^B
High Kick		_B^C
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Low Kick (knockdown)		_D^C
Launcher (crouch normal, then)		^C
  Jump cancel on hit.
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

