Homing Needles		_D_DF_F^B
Diagonal / Straight Needles (air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Teleport Kick		_D_DB_B^A
Teleport Kick Crossup		_D_DB_B^B
Dropkick / Teleport Kick (air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B
TP Throw		_F_D_DF^X

